@startuml
title UML state machine diagram for Online Quiz System

state "Unregistered" as Unregistered
Unregistered : entry/Initial State
Unregistered : do/Register or Login
Unregistered --> Registered : Register/Login

state "Registered" as Registered
Registered : entry/User Logged In
Registered : do/Continue as Teacher / Student
Registered --> Teacher : Continue as Teacher
Registered --> Student : Continue as Student

state "Teacher Home" as TeacherHome
TeacherHome : entry/Logged in as Teacher
TeacherHome : do/Create Quiz
TeacherHome : exit/Edit Quiz
TeacherHome : exit/Save Quiz Draft
TeacherHome : exit/Post Quiz for Students
TeacherHome : exit/View Quiz Results
TeacherHome --> CreateQuiz : [Create Quiz]
TeacherHome --> EditQuiz : [Edit Existing Quiz]
TeacherHome --> SaveDraft : [Save as Draft]
TeacherHome --> PostQuiz : [Post for Students]
TeacherHome --> ViewResults : [View Results]

state "Student Home" as StudentHome
StudentHome : entry/Logged in as Student
StudentHome : do/Select Quiz
StudentHome : exit/Answer Quiz
StudentHome : exit/Submit Quiz
StudentHome : exit/View Result
StudentHome --> SelectQuiz : [Select Quiz]
StudentHome --> AnswerQuiz : [Answer Selected Quiz]
StudentHome --> SubmitQuiz : [Submit Quiz]
StudentHome --> ViewResult : [View Result]

state "Create Quiz" as CreateQuiz
CreateQuiz : entry/Creating New Quiz
CreateQuiz : do/Configure Quiz Details
CreateQuiz : exit/Save and Continue

state "Edit Quiz" as EditQuiz
EditQuiz : entry/Editing Existing Quiz
EditQuiz : do/Modify Quiz Questions
EditQuiz : exit/Save Changes

state "Save Draft" as SaveDraft
SaveDraft : entry/Saving Quiz Draft
SaveDraft : do/Save Drafted Quiz
SaveDraft : exit/Draft Saved

state "Post Quiz for Students" as PostQuiz
PostQuiz : entry/Posting Quiz for Students
PostQuiz : do/Publicize Quiz
PostQuiz : exit/Quiz Posted

state "View Results" as ViewResults
ViewResults : entry/Viewing Quiz Results
ViewResults : do/Review Student Answers
ViewResults : exit/Results Reviewed

state "Answer Quiz" as AnswerQuiz
AnswerQuiz : entry/Answering Selected Quiz
AnswerQuiz : do/Respond to Questions
AnswerQuiz : exit/Quiz Answered

state "Submit Quiz" as SubmitQuiz
SubmitQuiz : entry/Submitting Quiz
SubmitQuiz : do/Finalize Answers
SubmitQuiz : exit/Quiz Submitted

state "View Result" as ViewResult
ViewResult : entry/Viewing Quiz Result
ViewResult : do/Review Personal Score
ViewResult : exit/Result Reviewed

[*] --> Unregistered
StudentHome --> [*] : Logout
TeacherHome --> [*] : Logout

@enduml
